{"strongs": "H1534", "word": "גַּלְגַּל", "translit": "gal.gal", "root": "גלגל", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "wheel, whirl, whirlwind", "definition": "גַּלְגַּל noun masculine Eccl 12:6 wheel, whirl, whirlwind (on formation compare Ba NB 204 ) — absolute ׳ ג Ezek 10:2 + 7 t.; גַּלְגַּ֑ל Ps 83:14 plural with suffix גַּלְגִּלָּיו Isa 5:28 ; Jer 47:3 — 1. wheel , \\ \\ a. of war-chariot Isa 5:28 ; Jer 47:3 , also collective Ezek 23:24 ; Ezek 26:10 perhaps also in Ezekiel's vision Ezek 10:2 ; Ezek 10:6 ; Ezek 10:13 (compare wheelwork ) but compare below \\ \\ b. for drawing water Eccl 12:6 . 2. a. whirl (of dust or chaff) Ps 83:14 ; Isa 17:13 , simile of foes put to flight by God. \\ \\ b. perhaps whirling of wheels Ezek 10:2 ; Ezek 10:6 ; Ezek 10:13 Sm RV , but compare above \\ \\ c. whirlwind Ps 77:19 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1660')\">BDB1660</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1534')\">H1534</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1659')\">BDB1659</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1661')\">BDB1661</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>גַּלְגַּל</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Eccl 12:6\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(21,12,6)\">Eccl 12:6</ref></sup> <highlightword>wheel, whirl, whirlwind</highlightword> (on formation compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ba')\">Ba<sup>NB 204</sup></lookup>) — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ג</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 10:2\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(26,10,2)\">Ezek 10:2</ref> + 7 t.; <bdbheb>גַּלְגַּ֑ל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 83:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"83\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"83\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,83,14)\">Ps 83:14</ref> plural with suffix <bdbheb>גַּלְגִּלָּיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 5:28\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,28)\">Isa 5:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 47:3\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegi